      "name": "Traveler's Lesson",
      "category": "interaction",
      "text": "Creatures that engage in conversation with the traveling priest gain a +2 circumstance bonus to all Recall Knowledge checks and Gather Information checks for 4 hours related to any topics discussed with the traveling priest."
